{"resourceIdentifier":"3177","resourceName":"Puyang County MSW Landfill Site LFG Pollution Treatment and Comprehensive Utilization Project","description":"Puyang County MSW Landfill Site LFG Pollution Treatment and Comprehensive Utilization Project is located at Puyang County MSW landfill site (hereafter referred to as the Puyang County landfill site), Qinghetou Town, Puyang County, Henan Province, P.R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Puyang County BCCY New Energy CO., Ltd. \r\nThe project started to construct on 29/09/2021.The project has a total designed capacity 1MW (2*0.5MW) and combusts the LFG, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the Central China Power Grid (CCPG). Total electricity supplied to the grid in the crediting period will be 52,888MWh. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reductions of the project is 31,961tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and removals are 319,610tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period. \r\nScenario existing prior to the implementation of the project (the same as baseline scenario):\r\nLFG from Puyang County landfill site is emitted to the atmosphere directly.\r\nEquivalent electricity generated by the project is supplied by the Central China Power Grid \r\n(CCPG), which is dominated by fossil fuel based power plants.","location":{"latitude":35.713388,"longitude":115.107658},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-07-05","endExclusive":"2022-08-05","endInclusive":"2022-08-04"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3177"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"31961"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.G."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"10/01/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/01/2022 - 31/12/2031"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=66484&IDKEY=qlksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098k91681436","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-Puyang-draft.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-05-13T08:45:23.15Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=66347&IDKEY=898klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8d991492513","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-v4.1-Puyang County.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-05-11T09:19:15.503Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=82395&IDKEY=fkjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909l113622705","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-Puyang-Clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-01-10T18:08:54.183Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=72838&IDKEY=hlksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln9023